{
  "_comment": [
    "Template only, and named so Codex cannot mistake it for the real thing.",
    "`agentgit install` writes hooks.json beside it, with the NODE and HOOK",
    "placeholders replaced by absolute paths on this machine. Codex performs no",
    "command substitution and does not resolve a POSIX-style relative script path on",
    "Windows, so absolute paths are the only form that works everywhere. That is why",
    "hooks.json is gitignored and this template is not.",
    "",
    "Matchers are deliberately broad. The dispatcher classifies the tool itself and",
    "ignores anything that cannot change a file, so a tool Codex renames or adds still",
    "gets recorded instead of silently dropping out of the ledger.",
    "",
    "One handler per event, and it is the dispatcher. Four scripts ran here before -",
    "track, spine, hub, desktop - so a session start spawned four Node processes and a",
    "file edit spawned two. Process startup, not the work, was the cost: scripts that do",
    "milliseconds of work paid tens of milliseconds each to boot. hook.mjs reads stdin",
    "once and runs the same steps in the same order inside one process.",
    "",
    "The order lives in hook.mjs and is what it always was: record first, then make sure a",
    "daemon is watching, then read the ruling, and only then consider asking the user a",
    "question. Spine and desktop are absent from PreToolUse on purpose - starting a daemon",
    "and asking a question have no business between an agent and its next edit - and the",
    "hub on PreToolUse is narrowed to file edits, because a ruling is only worth",
    "interrupting a write with when the write is about the ground it rules on.",
    "",
    "PostToolUse runs the hub as well, which it does not do for a global ruling: a ruling",
    "is only worth interrupting a write with, and by the time a tool has finished there is",
    "nothing left to interrupt. It is there for the impact protocol, whose deferred",
    "notifications are explicitly not allowed to reach an in-progress tool. PreToolUse",
    "carries that protocol's interrupt-class items, PostToolUse its deferred ones."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "\"{{NODE}}\" \"{{HOOK}}\"" }]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "\"{{NODE}}\" \"{{HOOK}}\"" }]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": ".*",
        "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "\"{{NODE}}\" \"{{HOOK}}\"" }]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": ".*",
        "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "\"{{NODE}}\" \"{{HOOK}}\"" }]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "\"{{NODE}}\" \"{{HOOK}}\"" }]
      }
    ]
  }
}
